{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">奇瑞汽車旗下五個品牌七月的汽車銷量超過26萬輛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">按年增長兩成四，按月升近百分之9。累計今年首七個月，共賣出超過153萬輛車，按年增長一成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T01:17:53.004372+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}